sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Membership and administrative access require separate setup
accDescr: After an invitation is accepted, member administrators create role trust and permissions, and the authorized management role assumes that member role.
participant M as Management account
participant A as Existing member account
M->>A: Send organization invitation
A->>M: Accept invitation
Note over A: Create admin role and trust designated caller
Note over M: Allow caller to assume member role
M->>A: STS AssumeRole
A-->>M: Temporary role credentials
